cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: 'MATLAB code for "Moving Without Making Progress: Shorter Forward Runs Explain the Loss of Net Advance in a Model of Swedish Mutant Amyloid Precursor Protein Transport"'
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of a five-state stochastic model of bidirectional
  axonal cargo transport and of its continuum advection-reaction counterpart,
  applied to wild-type and Swedish mutant amyloid precursor protein (APP), Rab5
  endosomes and lysosomes in human neurons. Includes the trajectory simulator
  with its observation model, the fitting routines, the fitted parameter sets,
  the spatial and fluorescence models, the analysis scripts with their saved
  outputs, a master script that reproduces the quoted numbers from the saved
  fits, and the scripts that regenerate Figs. 1-5. Base MATLAB only; no
  toolboxes required.
type: software
